<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>under the shining star-lit sky, with countless constellations and shadows</b></font></font></font></font>

33
00:01:05,710 --> 00:01:15,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>sono saki ni kimi wa nani wo nani wo mitsumete iru darou</b></font></font></font></font>

34
00:01:05,710 --> 00:01:15,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>there was something beyond that, what were you gazing at?</b></font></font></font></font>

35
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>nani wo mitsumete iru darou</b></font></font></font></font>

36
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>what were you gazing at?</b></font></font></font></font>

37
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:41,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys did good work.
Komei has confessed.</font>

38
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:44,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems he plotted the Cursed Warrior</font>

39
00:01:44,700 --> 00:01:49,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to mislead the public
and to take the feudal-lord position.</font>

40
00:01:49,630 --> 00:01:52,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that what Komei said?</font>

41
00:01:52,090 --> 00:01:54,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. It turned out to be such a trifle.</font>

42
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:57,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Cursed Warrior's vanishing</font>

43
00:01:57,430 --> 00:01:59,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was a soldier disguising himself
as the warrior</font>

44
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:04,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">using a strong nitrohydrochloric acid
to melt his own flesh.</font>

45
00:02:15,190 --> 00:02:17,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's empty again.</font>

46
00:02:19,950 --> 00:02:22,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this,
the Cursed Warrior incident is resolved.</font>

47
00:02:22,830 --> 00:02:24,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now the Land of Birds should return</font>

48
00:02:24,790 --> 00:02:27,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to the beautiful and quiet land
it used to be.</font>

49
00:02:27,460 --> 00:02:29,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just a minute!</font>

50
00:02:29,290 --> 00:02:31,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the Cursed Warrior still isn't...!</font>

51
00:02:31,250 --> 00:02:33,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Don't bother.
— But...!</font>

52
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:36,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now you are relieved of your duty.</font>

53
00:02:37,010 --> 00:02:39,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have a safe journey back to your village.</font>

54
00:02:45,770 --> 00:02:48,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?!</font>

55
00:02:50,020 --> 00:02:51,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You said the one we saw first</font>

56
00:02:51,810 --> 00:02:54,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the one last night were different,
right?</font>

57
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:57,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps there were multiple people
disguised as the Cursed Warrior,</font>

58
00:02:57,530 --> 00:02:59,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">not just one alone.</font>

59
00:02:59,650 --> 00:03:01,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If there was a person inside disguised,</font>

60
00:03:02,030 --> 00:03:04,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then how do you explain
the warrior flying?</font>

61
00:03:04,580 --> 00:03:06,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As long as our mission
has been ordered complete,</font>

62
00:03:06,910 --> 00:03:09,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's no reason to continue the mission
in this land now.</font>

63
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:14,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides,
Komei confessed to the crime, right?</font>

64
00:03:14,250 --> 00:03:16,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's suspicious.</font>

65
00:03:16,420 --> 00:03:19,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't go along with it
if I don't get the whole story.</font>

66
00:03:19,670 --> 00:03:22,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This land has its own circumstances.</font>

67
00:03:22,590 --> 00:03:24,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Getting too involved will cause trouble.</font>

68
00:03:27,100 --> 00:03:29,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Then I'll just have to do it my way.
— Hold it.</font>

69
00:03:30,690 --> 00:03:32,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the leader of this team.</font>

70
00:03:35,020 --> 00:03:36,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what?</font>

71
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:40,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You look into the movements
of the Cursed Warrior once more.</font>

72
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:43,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tenten and I will reinvestigate
this incident from a different angle.</font>

73
00:03:43,660 --> 00:03:46,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? But the mission's over.</font>

74
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:49,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have a point with what you said.</font>

75
00:03:50,370 --> 00:03:52,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everything is moving along
too swimmingly.</font>

76
00:03:52,750 --> 00:03:54,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Leave it to me.</font>

77
00:03:57,300 --> 00:03:59,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Where are you going, Naruto?</font>

78
00:03:59,760 --> 00:04:01,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't it obvious?</font>

79
00:04:01,420 --> 00:04:04,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— To investigate the Cursed Warrior.
— What?</font>

80
00:04:07,220 --> 00:04:08,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Chishima.</font>

81
00:04:10,100 --> 00:04:11,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, just now...</font>

82
00:04:12,140 --> 00:04:14,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's nothing, it's nothing.</font>

83
00:04:14,650 --> 00:04:17,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Did you have business with us?
— Oh, yes.</font>

84
00:04:20,280 --> 00:04:22,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have all been so helpful
to me the whole time...</font>

85
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:27,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I feel so bad about that low payment.</font>

86
00:04:27,830 --> 00:04:29,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Additional money?</font>

87
00:04:30,080 --> 00:04:31,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We couldn't...</font>

88
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:34,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, it's the specialty of
the Land of Birds.</font>

89
00:04:34,170 --> 00:04:36,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chicken-wing buns filled with bean jam.</font>

90
00:04:43,260 --> 00:04:46,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yakitori Tsurucho</font>

91
00:04:56,310 --> 00:04:57,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks.</font>

92
00:05:23,050 --> 00:05:25,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure enough, this area's fishy.</font>

93
00:05:26,380 --> 00:05:28,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's kind of time-consuming
searching alone...</font>

94
00:05:32,180 --> 00:05:33,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning Jutsu.</font>

95
00:05:38,270 --> 00:05:41,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Long time no see.
Are you giving me a snack?</font>

96
00:05:42,020 --> 00:05:44,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is it you guys?</font>

97
00:05:44,940 --> 00:05:46,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dad's busy with stuff, so...</font>

98
00:05:46,950 --> 00:05:51,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I can't have Boss Gama
appearing, either.</font>

99
00:05:51,950 --> 00:05:54,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I guess it can't be helped.</font>

100
00:05:54,660 --> 00:05:58,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys have a better sense of smell
than humans, right?</font>

101
00:05:58,250 --> 00:05:59,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're calling us puppies?</font>

102
00:06:00,250 --> 00:06:03,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez. Toad authority
has sure hit rock bottom.</font>

103
00:06:03,630 --> 00:06:05,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gamatatsu, we're leaving.</font>

104
00:06:08,430 --> 00:06:09,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gamatatsu?</font>

105
00:06:10,090 --> 00:06:11,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Gamatatsu!</font>

106
00:06:15,140 --> 00:06:17,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A frog that pounces
on a willow leaf?</font>

107
00:06:17,850 --> 00:06:19,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing, you idiot?</font>

108
00:06:19,900 --> 00:06:21,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Big Brother Gamakichi!</font>

109
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:24,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder what this is!</font>

110
00:06:27,320 --> 00:06:31,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whoa, it's dark! It's night!</font>

111
00:06:32,870 --> 00:06:34,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good night.</font>

112
00:06:39,250 --> 00:06:40,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good morning.</font>

113
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?</font>

114
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:45,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a kite painted black.</font>

115
00:06:45,090 --> 00:06:48,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— A kite?
— Look up there.</font>

116
00:06:49,430 --> 00:06:52,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a totally huge kite.</font>

117
00:06:52,260 --> 00:06:56,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if there was
a big kite-flying festival or something.</font>

118
00:06:56,600 --> 00:07:00,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's rather plain for a festival kite.</font>

119
00:07:00,900 --> 00:07:03,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? What does that mean?</font>

120
00:07:03,690 --> 00:07:06,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Oh, no!
— Hey. Where are you going?</font>

121
00:07:09,650 --> 00:07:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm back.</font>

122
00:07:21,580 --> 00:07:25,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I get it. If one were to fly that
in the cover of a dark night,</font>

123
00:07:25,960 --> 00:07:28,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a Cursed Warrior hanging on
to the black kite</font>

124
00:07:28,090 --> 00:07:30,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">would look like he was flying.</font>

125
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:33,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With this, the mystery
of the flying warrior is solved,</font>

126
00:07:35,970 --> 00:07:36,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next...</font>

127
00:07:40,980 --> 00:07:44,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Someone was here on that night.</font>

128
00:07:50,950 --> 00:07:52,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

129
00:07:54,870 --> 00:07:57,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Cursed Warrior came out from here.</font>

130
00:08:01,460 --> 00:08:05,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It just looks like an old temple
that isn't used much at all.</font>

131
00:08:06,170 --> 00:08:09,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— You're right.
— Let's go, Gamatatsu.</font>

132
00:08:10,010 --> 00:08:15,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, Big Brother Gamakichi,
it's nice and cool here.</font>

133
00:08:15,590 --> 00:08:19,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you talking about?
In such a hot and humid temple...</font>

134
00:08:23,770 --> 00:08:27,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Indeed, that's a nice damp wind.</font>

135
00:08:28,070 --> 00:08:31,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See? Isn't it comfortable?</font>

136
00:08:31,820 --> 00:08:33,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Draft from down below here?</font>

137
00:08:44,250 --> 00:08:45,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?</font>

138
00:08:45,920 --> 00:08:51,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow, I wonder if a giant worm made this.</font>

139
00:08:52,090 --> 00:08:54,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or a mole.</font>

140
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:56,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, let's check it out.</font>

141
00:08:57,140 --> 00:09:01,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder how we should greet a mole
if we meet one.</font>

142
00:09:02,390 --> 00:09:03,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like I care.</font>

143
00:09:07,940 --> 00:09:11,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, Naruto is still investigating
the Cursed Warrior, huh?</font>

144
00:09:12,150 --> 00:09:15,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I should probably inform Lord Moso.</font>

145
00:09:19,950 --> 00:09:22,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There was some trouble caused,</font>

146
00:09:22,450 --> 00:09:25,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but we have at last found a safe refuge.</font>

147
00:09:47,850 --> 00:09:48,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After him!</font>

148
00:09:56,780 --> 00:09:59,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Big brother, where are we?</font>

149
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:01,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This place is...</font>

150
00:10:03,290 --> 00:10:06,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the residence
of the feudal lord, isn't it?</font>

151
00:10:06,160 --> 00:10:09,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really? Residence of the feudal lord?</font>

152
00:10:09,580 --> 00:10:11,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No wonder it's an impressive building.</font>

153
00:10:12,420 --> 00:10:14,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was connected to this place?</font>

154
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:20,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that sound?</font>

155
00:10:29,940 --> 00:10:31,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a nice view.</font>

156
00:10:31,810 --> 00:10:33,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey. What are you doing?</font>

157
00:10:34,070 --> 00:10:36,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Keep quiet. We'll be discovered.</font>

158
00:10:38,650 --> 00:10:40,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Big Brother Gamakichi!</font>

159
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You blockhead!</font>

160
00:10:50,920 --> 00:10:52,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good work with your duties.</font>

161
00:10:52,710 --> 00:10:54,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As for me, I'm not anyone suspicious.</font>

162
00:10:56,420 --> 00:10:59,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was asked here
by Superintendent Moso and...</font>

163
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:03,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm investigating the incident...</font>

164
00:11:04,220 --> 00:11:07,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll make sense
if I tell you about it.</font>

165
00:11:10,100 --> 00:11:13,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Sagi.
We have captured a suspicious man.</font>

166
00:11:13,560 --> 00:11:14,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What shall we do with him?</font>

167
00:11:16,940 --> 00:11:17,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

168
00:11:18,990 --> 00:11:22,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sagi, bro. Hey.
We met at the lake, didn't we?</font>

169
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:25,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Explain to them about me.</font>

170
00:11:27,040 --> 00:11:28,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know no such person.</font>

171
00:11:28,830 --> 00:11:30,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

172
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:33,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's not worth sending
to the magistrate's office.</font>

173
00:11:33,670 --> 00:11:36,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Lock him in the dungeon.
— Yes, my lord.</font>

174
00:11:36,500 --> 00:11:40,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, that's harsh. Come on, Sagi!</font>

175
00:11:40,930 --> 00:11:46,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Wait a minute! Come on! Hey!</font>

176
00:12:44,450 --> 00:12:47,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on. This is a misunderstanding.</font>

177
00:12:47,450 --> 00:12:49,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was just going after the Cursed Warrior.</font>

178
00:12:49,660 --> 00:12:54,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everything will make sense
if you just ask Mr. Moso.</font>

179
00:12:54,420 --> 00:12:55,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You okay?</font>

180
00:12:57,920 --> 00:12:58,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yo.</font>

181
00:12:58,960 --> 00:13:02,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't be fighting the soldiers
of my employer's land.</font>

182
00:13:04,010 --> 00:13:07,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez. You had to go and get caught
in that trap.</font>

183
00:13:10,060 --> 00:13:11,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it's cool.</font>

184
00:13:11,970 --> 00:13:14,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can get out of a place like this
right away</font>

185
00:13:14,100 --> 00:13:15,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if I just use both my hands.</font>

186
00:13:15,730 --> 00:13:19,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hey, untie this.
— Right. Just a second.</font>

187
00:13:22,860 --> 00:13:23,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?</font>

188
00:13:52,060 --> 00:13:53,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Cursed Warrior?</font>

189
00:14:38,390 --> 00:14:40,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it.</font>

190
00:14:40,150 --> 00:14:42,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I could just use both hands,
this guy would be...</font>

191
00:14:43,150 --> 00:14:45,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Big Brother,
are we going to let things be?</font>

192
00:14:45,650 --> 00:14:48,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If things go wrong,
we could be sliced in two.</font>

193
00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:50,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wouldn't want that.</font>

194
00:15:09,340 --> 00:15:11,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just a little more...</font>

195
00:15:32,490 --> 00:15:34,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just a little more.</font>

196
00:16:20,580 --> 00:16:21,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sagi?</font>

197
00:16:24,250 --> 00:16:26,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on here?</font>

198
00:16:26,750 --> 00:16:29,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the other Cursed Warrior?</font>

199
00:16:29,760 --> 00:16:31,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But why?</font>

200
00:16:34,930 --> 00:16:37,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They say people become disembodied spirits
and avenge themselves</font>

201
00:16:40,350 --> 00:16:41,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But that's a lie!</font>

202
00:16:43,390 --> 00:16:46,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This watch has been handed down
from generation to generation</font>

203
00:16:46,520 --> 00:16:47,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the feudal-lord family.</font>

204
00:16:49,690 --> 00:16:52,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was supposed to be passed
from father to son.</font>

205
00:16:55,820 --> 00:17:01,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But now, along with that death,
the watch has stopped ticking away.</font>

206
00:17:04,290 --> 00:17:06,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It must have been very sad.</font>

207
00:17:14,720 --> 00:17:18,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am shamelessly living on
only for the sake of revenge.</font>

208
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:23,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can go to hell
if I can just complete my revenge.</font>

209
00:17:23,140 --> 00:17:24,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's no good.</font>

210
00:17:24,890 --> 00:17:26,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is no way you could understand</font>

211
00:17:26,850 --> 00:17:29,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">how someone who's had everything
taken from them feels.</font>

212
00:17:29,480 --> 00:17:31,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like I know about stuff like that.</font>

213
00:17:33,650 --> 00:17:38,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I at least know that living
for the sake of revenge is wrong.</font>

214
00:17:43,700 --> 00:17:46,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're a feudal lord, aren't you?</font>

215
00:17:46,370 --> 00:17:49,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is revenge the job of a feudal lord?
You know that's not it.</font>

216
00:17:52,050 --> 00:17:55,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The true culprit, Komei,
has been arrested.</font>

217
00:17:55,720 --> 00:18:00,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should just leave the rest to Moso.
Okay?</font>

218
00:18:06,560 --> 00:18:08,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is no concern of yours.</font>

219
00:18:10,520 --> 00:18:11,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must not let you live...</font>

220
00:18:12,610 --> 00:18:15,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">now that you have learned everything.</font>

221
00:18:17,320 --> 00:18:20,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As a thief who snuck into the residence
of the feudal lord,</font>

222
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:22,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">your fate is a death sentence.</font>

223
00:18:24,450 --> 00:18:25,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way.</font>

224
00:18:28,790 --> 00:18:30,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is creepy.</font>

225
00:18:30,750 --> 00:18:33,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the tomb of the successive
generations of feudal lords, right?</font>

226
00:18:34,050 --> 00:18:37,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. That's the tomb of the Lord Owashi.</font>

227
00:18:41,140 --> 00:18:42,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan.</font>

228
00:18:53,400 --> 00:18:54,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?</font>

229
00:18:56,440 --> 00:18:59,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it, Neji? What are you seeing?</font>

230
00:19:02,200 --> 00:19:05,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's something poisonous
in Owashi's body.</font>

231
00:19:09,160 --> 00:19:10,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was he assassinated?</font>

232
00:19:24,970 --> 00:19:26,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're surrounded.</font>

233
00:19:32,850 --> 00:19:35,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An announcement to the ninja
from the Leaf Village.</font>

234
00:19:36,860 --> 00:19:40,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A message has just been delivered
from the residence of the feudal lord.</font>

235
00:19:40,950 --> 00:19:42,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your comrade has been arrested</font>

236
00:19:42,530 --> 00:19:44,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for infiltrating the residence
of the feudal lord,</font>

237
00:19:45,450 --> 00:19:47,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and his death sentence
has been determined.</font>

238
00:19:49,370 --> 00:19:52,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave the Land of Birds at once.</font>

239
00:19:52,420 --> 00:19:57,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't, you will be executed here
for the same crime.</font>

240
00:20:00,510 --> 00:20:02,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't matter. Draw your bows.</font>

241
00:20:13,850 --> 00:20:16,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Neji, what should we do?
— Go to the residence of the feudal lord.</font>

242
00:20:17,020 --> 00:20:18,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're going to save Naruto.</font>

243
00:20:29,370 --> 00:20:30,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're...</font>

244
00:20:31,750 --> 00:20:34,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi-sensei. Naruto's in trouble.</font>

245
00:20:34,330 --> 00:20:37,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have to go to the residence
of the feudal lord and save him.</font>

246
00:20:37,630 --> 00:20:38,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can't do that.</font>

247
00:20:41,590 --> 00:20:44,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Your mission is over.
— But...</font>

248
00:20:45,510 --> 00:20:47,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't do anything
other than the mission.</font>

249
00:21:18,970 --> 00:21:30,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>dokomademo tsudzuku michi ni wa ironna koto arunda ne</b></font></font></font></font>

250
00:21:18,970 --> 00:21:30,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>so many things happen on this endless road, right?</b></font></font></font></font>

251
00:21:30,650 --> 00:21:42,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>tsuyogari na kimi ga kyou wa juwaki koshi ni namida koe</b></font></font></font></font>

252
00:21:30,650 --> 00:21:42,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>although you're strong-willed your voice wavered on the phone today</b></font></font></font></font>

253
00:21:42,250 --> 00:21:53,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>donna yume oikakete kokomade kitan darou</b></font></font></font></font>

254
00:21:42,250 --> 00:21:53,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>what dreams did you chase to get here?</b></font></font></font></font>

255
00:21:53,040 --> 00:22:05,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>wakara na kunattari suru koto wa boku ni datte aru kara nee BABY</b></font></font></font></font>

256
00:21:53,040 --> 00:22:05,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>even I have times when I just don't understand baby</b></font></font></font></font>

257
00:22:05,380 --> 00:22:16,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>kimi ga namida no toki ni wa boku ga soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

258
00:22:05,380 --> 00:22:16,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>when you're sad I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

259
00:22:16,900 --> 00:22:28,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>hanareba nare no yoru datte boku wa soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

260
00:22:16,900 --> 00:22:28,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>even on nights when we're apart I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

261
00:22:28,500 --> 00:22:34,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>boku wa soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

262
00:22:28,500 --> 00:22:34,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

263
00:22:39,540 --> 00:22:41,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Are we really going back
to the village like this?</font>

264
00:22:42,090 --> 00:22:45,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I told you. Our mission in
the Land of Birds is finished now.</font>

265
00:22:45,880 --> 00:22:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">But then, what'll happen
to Naruto?</font>

266
00:22:48,170 --> 00:22:50,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">We can't interfere with
this land's internal affairs.</font>

267
00:22:50,300 --> 00:22:51,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">No way...</font>

268
00:22:51,760 --> 00:22:55,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Sorry. The responsibility rests
on me, the leader.</font>

269
00:22:56,100 --> 00:23:00,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Let it go... Sacrifice is
a part of Shinobi missions.</font>

270
00:23:01,270 --> 00:23:03,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Naruto Dies."</font>

